{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:04a2e45b858fbba7","name":"EMP Grenade","source":{"id":"source:reference-04a2e45b858fbba7","title":"EMP Grenade","revision":19889,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:48:25Z","sha256":"dffe0654e52818988b1f24029138b38a6541bdbd3d9bd844a4d57313b4d22001","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19889","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=EMP%20Grenade&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-04a2e45b858fbba7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Often referred to by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Troopers"}," of the Republic as \"Droid Poppers,\" EMP Grenades are similar to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Grenades"}," in most respects. The biggest difference between EMP Grenades and standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Grenades"}," is that they can completely shut down relatively weak ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," with an EMP Grenade, you make a single attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target in the grenade's 2-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures hit by the EMP Grenade take normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage, or half damage on a miss. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage from a successful attack, and no damage if the attack misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage dealt by the weapon would reduce a target to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," (before the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage is halved), the target is pushed -5 steps down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," and disabled. Creatures without cybernetics take half ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage on a hit or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage on a miss, and they suffer no other ill effects.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d6 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," Radius:"]}," 2-Squares\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy (",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
